Embedded EPG import engine
--------------------------

The directory

    Plugins/Extensions/EpgToXml/epgimport_engine/

contains the EPG import engine taken from the EPGImport plugin
(enigma2-plugin-extensions-epgimport), licensed under the GPLv2. Only the
import engine is vendored (no user interface). The files were copied verbatim
(only intra-package import statements were adjusted and an SPDX/license header
was added) from:

    EPGImport.py, EPGConfig.py, xmltvconverter.py, gen_xmltv.py,
    epgdat_importer.py, epgdb.py, epgdat.py, log.py

